<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Authorization failed</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/index.css">
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<p class="eyebrow">Authorization failed</p>
<h1>We couldn’t complete sign-in</h1>
<p class="lede">The operation failed. This may be caused by a bug or a configuration error in the application or identity provider.</p>
</section>
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="error-title">
<h2 id="error-title">Error detail</h2>
<p class="error-box authorization-error-detail">{{detail}}</p>
{{#if code}}
<p class="muted">Error code: <code>{{code}}</code></p>
{{/if}}
<p>Try starting authentication again from the application. If it keeps failing, share this error detail with the application’s or identity provider’s administrator.</p>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
